WEBVTT

00:00:06.507 --> 00:00:10.094
It is no exaggeration to say that this battle...

00:00:10.344 --> 00:00:15.725
...will determine the fate of the world.

00:00:15.808 --> 00:00:19.729
This will be the greatest battle
the world has ever seen.

00:00:19.812 --> 00:00:25.610
The Winged Priestesses will strike
down the Federation's vanguard fleet.

00:00:25.693 --> 00:00:28.196
I anticipate a grueling battle of attrition.

00:00:28.279 --> 00:00:32.992
Even if the enemy has a plan to counterattack...

00:00:34.035 --> 00:00:36.787
...we are ready to take the next step.

00:00:36.871 --> 00:00:39.332
The real issue is that...

00:00:39.415 --> 00:00:43.127
...the enemy's military might is
unknown and shrouded in mystery.

00:00:43.211 --> 00:00:45.129
But fear not.

00:00:45.213 --> 00:00:49.383
For we have the ultimate weapon...

00:00:53.012 --> 00:00:55.139
--Exile!
--Exile!

00:00:55.223 --> 00:01:01.812
<i>No matter what might await us there</i>

00:01:02.063 --> 00:01:10.488
<i>I'll go to unexplored territory with you</i>

00:01:18.746 --> 00:01:26.796
<i>I just had a short dream</i>

00:01:27.046 --> 00:01:31.425
<i>In it, I saw your back</i>

00:01:31.676 --> 00:01:37.598
<i>Was it the past? The future?</i>

00:01:37.848 --> 00:01:48.359
<i>Ignore the needle on that meter
pointing to the red zone</i>

00:01:48.609 --> 00:01:51.487
<i>And go where the tailwinds
and your feelings point you</i>

00:01:51.737 --> 00:01:57.660
<i>Every time I flap my wings, it makes me realize</i>

00:01:57.910 --> 00:02:03.207
<i>That there are skies
I'll never be able to see again</i>

00:02:03.457 --> 00:02:08.713
<i>But if you still want to take flight</i>

00:02:08.963 --> 00:02:15.511
<i>Then I will be your wings</i>

00:02:32.903 --> 00:02:34.905
Those aren't their main fleets...

00:02:35.156 --> 00:02:36.615
They're not the Federation's?

00:02:36.866 --> 00:02:41.454
No. They're flying the
Federation's flags, but they're...!

00:02:43.539 --> 00:02:45.583
<i>Those</i> are the Federation's main fleets...!

00:02:48.502 --> 00:02:51.130
We have to tell Dyan right away!

00:02:58.721 --> 00:03:03.476
Enemy fleet detected! Scramble all ships!

00:03:03.726 --> 00:03:05.186
Scramble!

00:03:23.621 --> 00:03:26.457
O Winged Goddess, grant us your protection...

00:03:31.712 --> 00:03:33.839
The Chaos fleet being sent into battle...

00:03:34.090 --> 00:03:36.717
I never imagined this day would come, Vimal!

00:03:36.967 --> 00:03:39.637
Yes, it's our first time since
joining the Federation fleets.

00:03:39.887 --> 00:03:44.392
Yes. We'll wipe out Glacies single-handedly!

00:03:44.642 --> 00:03:45.559
Status report!

00:03:45.810 --> 00:03:47.686
Three miles to Glacies border.

00:03:47.937 --> 00:03:49.271
Speed, 80 knots.

00:03:49.522 --> 00:03:50.898
We'll cross the border in two minutes.

00:03:51.148 --> 00:03:55.027
All hands to battle stations!
Prepare for anti-Vanship combat!

00:03:55.277 --> 00:03:56.987
Prepare for anti-Vanship combat!

00:03:57.238 --> 00:03:59.448
Shell type, time-delay incendiary spread!

00:03:59.698 --> 00:04:02.451
Thundercloud developing ahead!

00:04:03.994 --> 00:04:05.663
Now crossing the border!

00:04:08.124 --> 00:04:09.458
That's no thundercloud!

00:04:09.708 --> 00:04:11.335
It's Glacies!

00:04:14.547 --> 00:04:15.756
Dinesh! Target them!

00:04:16.006 --> 00:04:17.633
I can't! I can't keep up!

00:04:17.883 --> 00:04:19.385
What are these--

00:04:37.194 --> 00:04:38.487
Hurry, Fam!

00:04:38.737 --> 00:04:40.322
We're already at full speed!

00:04:40.573 --> 00:04:43.200
The full-boost will only last 20 more seconds!

00:04:43.451 --> 00:04:47.121
--Any longer and we'll fry the engine!
--C'mon, hang in a little longer!

00:04:50.291 --> 00:04:51.750
There they are!

00:04:54.086 --> 00:04:59.925
Reporting! Attack on intruding
enemy vanguard successful!

00:05:00.176 --> 00:05:04.930
Estimated number of ships downed: 120.

00:05:05.181 --> 00:05:06.932
Ships destroyed: 150.

00:05:07.183 --> 00:05:10.895
54% of fleet annihilated.

00:05:11.145 --> 00:05:14.440
Praise be to our protectors,
the Winged Priestesses!

00:05:14.690 --> 00:05:19.904
Those foreign savages are
no match for our Priestesses!

00:05:20.154 --> 00:05:22.698
Utterly annihilate them...

00:05:22.948 --> 00:05:28.913
...so they'll think twice about
ever nearing our territory again!

00:05:29.163 --> 00:05:32.583
O, Winged Goddess, please protect Glacies.

00:05:33.792 --> 00:05:35.628
Refueling complete.

00:05:35.878 --> 00:05:38.047
Good. Now let's head out.

00:05:49.934 --> 00:05:52.311
Third wave now engaging.

00:05:54.605 --> 00:05:56.607
There's no prey left there.

00:06:02.738 --> 00:06:05.574
80% of the vanguard fleets have been lost.

00:06:05.824 --> 00:06:09.036
They weren't just destroyed; they were
completely chewed up and spit out.

00:06:09.286 --> 00:06:12.331
After this, it's unlikely the provincial
fleets can ever be reconstructed.

00:06:12.581 --> 00:06:15.626
Indeed. We will avenge them.

00:06:15.876 --> 00:06:18.045
All ships, prepare for anti-aircraft combat!

00:06:18.295 --> 00:06:19.588
Form a combat box!

00:06:19.838 --> 00:06:22.007
All ships, prepare for anti-aircraft combat!

00:06:22.258 --> 00:06:24.635
Activate all rapid-fire control systems!

00:06:36.564 --> 00:06:39.817
They're past the border now, Fam!
Watch out for stray shells!

00:06:40.067 --> 00:06:41.569
R°gefl

00:06:42.861 --> 00:06:44.613
There they are!

00:06:44.863 --> 00:06:47.116
Please, hang in there just a little longer!

00:06:47.366 --> 00:06:50.160
We only have three more
seconds of over-boost!

00:06:50.411 --> 00:06:51.954
Thanks, Giselle!

00:06:57.543 --> 00:07:00.254
All ships, attack formation!

00:07:06.343 --> 00:07:07.344
The vanguard is a decoy!

00:07:07.595 --> 00:07:12.349
The 3rd Fleet is behind it,
armed with a new anti-Vanship weapon!

00:07:12.433 --> 00:07:14.602
What are you doing here?!

00:07:23.277 --> 00:07:27.489
--Urgh! Why won't she listen?!
--She can't understand, Fam!

00:07:27.573 --> 00:07:30.242
Dyan! The vanguard is a decoy!

00:07:30.492 --> 00:07:36.165
The 3rd Fleet is behind it,
armed with new anti-Vanship weaponry!

00:07:36.415 --> 00:07:39.001
All ships, cease attack!

00:07:40.419 --> 00:07:41.587
It's too late!

00:07:41.837 --> 00:07:44.923
Rear units, remain here.

00:07:45.174 --> 00:07:46.800
"Let's go!
“R°gefl

00:07:54.099 --> 00:07:56.685
Enemy squadrons are commencing attack runs!

00:07:56.935 --> 00:07:58.437
We have them now.

00:07:58.687 --> 00:07:59.855
All ships, open fire!

00:08:00.105 --> 00:08:01.690
Open fire!

00:08:13.369 --> 00:08:14.411
It's a success!

00:08:14.662 --> 00:08:17.581
It's too early to celebrate. Keep the attack up.

00:08:17.831 --> 00:08:19.750
Don't let a single one escape alive!

00:08:23.337 --> 00:08:24.588
What the...?!

00:08:24.838 --> 00:08:27.007
That's the Federation's new weapon.

00:08:27.257 --> 00:08:29.885
We got caught by it too.

00:08:29.968 --> 00:08:32.054
Signal from the 3rd Fleet!

00:08:32.304 --> 00:08:34.181
It's finally my turn, huh?

00:08:34.431 --> 00:08:36.850
Leave some for me too, Grang.

00:08:37.101 --> 00:08:38.727
You're putting my swift reputation to shame.

00:08:38.977 --> 00:08:41.313
All ships, 3rd combat speed!

00:08:52.282 --> 00:08:56.537
Destroy every last one!
Avenge the provincial fleets!

00:09:02.668 --> 00:09:06.588
The Federation's 4th Fleet,
led by Sorfish the Swift!

00:09:06.839 --> 00:09:08.424
Hurry! Get out of there!

00:09:10.843 --> 00:09:11.969
Splendid results.

00:09:12.219 --> 00:09:14.805
Yes. Send word back home.

00:09:19.143 --> 00:09:22.396
Land offensives aren't my
area of expertise, but...

00:09:22.646 --> 00:09:25.065
Target the Glacies stronghold!

00:09:25.315 --> 00:09:28.652
All ships, combat positions!
Shell type, incendiary spread!

00:09:30.154 --> 00:09:34.366
2nd through 8th Interceptor
Squadrons wiped out.

00:09:34.616 --> 00:09:42.916
9th through 12th Squadrons not
responding and are late returning to base.

00:09:43.167 --> 00:09:45.252
The Winged Priestesses have fallen?

00:09:45.502 --> 00:09:49.798
Make ready the secondary air defenses.

00:09:50.048 --> 00:09:53.761
O Winged Goddess, grant us your protection...

00:09:59.266 --> 00:10:00.851
How many ships do we have?

00:10:01.101 --> 00:10:04.938
Only 18 left, including ours.

00:10:06.440 --> 00:10:08.692
You don't have enough to fight!
Let's get out of here!

00:10:08.776 --> 00:10:13.655
That's not enough to fight with.
We have to escape for now.

00:10:13.906 --> 00:10:17.284
As long as the enemy remains,
we <i>will</i> keep fighting.

00:10:17.534 --> 00:10:20.829
Even down to our last ship.

00:10:21.079 --> 00:10:22.956
But, your base...

00:10:23.207 --> 00:10:25.125
We have other bases we can regroup at.

00:10:25.375 --> 00:10:28.045
I am grateful for the information.

00:10:28.128 --> 00:10:29.713
Thank you...

00:10:58.909 --> 00:11:03.205
Secondary air defenses... attack!

00:11:08.377 --> 00:11:11.171
Now that they're out of the way,
our next target is--

00:11:19.429 --> 00:11:21.765
All ships, take evasive action!

00:11:26.562 --> 00:11:28.272
Commence bombardment!

00:11:31.358 --> 00:11:34.027
1st Squadron, target Block A1!

00:11:34.278 --> 00:11:37.197
2nd Squadron, target Block B3!

00:11:37.447 --> 00:11:41.118
--3rd Squadron...
--To think they were still hiding such weapons...

00:11:41.368 --> 00:11:42.911
We were careless.

00:11:47.124 --> 00:11:48.750
Just in time.

00:11:49.001 --> 00:11:52.170
Show Glades what the Swift Fleet is capable of!

00:12:04.892 --> 00:12:07.227
It's the 4th Fleet!

00:12:07.477 --> 00:12:09.980
Sorfish the Swift is true to his title.

00:12:14.860 --> 00:12:17.696
I hope Dyan and the others will be all right...

00:12:17.946 --> 00:12:20.574
They'll be fine! I know it!

00:12:20.824 --> 00:12:24.536
It really has turned into a war.

00:12:24.786 --> 00:12:27.706
This world is nothing but war,
wherever you go...

00:12:29.791 --> 00:12:33.837
Everyone smiled so much on the
day of the Grand Race, though...

00:12:34.087 --> 00:12:36.256
This isn't right at all!

00:12:39.176 --> 00:12:42.387
It's just the three of us again...

00:12:46.433 --> 00:12:50.354
The Glacies counterattack has
taken out 6% of the 2nd Fleet,

00:12:50.604 --> 00:12:52.648
but our offensive continues
to progress smoothly!

00:13:01.490 --> 00:13:03.909
We need to find the Silvius first.

00:13:04.159 --> 00:13:05.869
I hope they're all right...

00:13:06.119 --> 00:13:08.205
We're talking about the Reaper.
They're just fine!

00:13:08.455 --> 00:13:11.416
Good point. But where could it be?

00:13:11.667 --> 00:13:14.252
Should we visit this "Anatoray" of theirs?

00:13:14.503 --> 00:13:17.589
I heard it's really far to the east...

00:13:17.839 --> 00:13:19.508
We need more information.

00:13:19.758 --> 00:13:22.511
Perhaps we should return to Kartoffel first.

00:13:22.761 --> 00:13:24.262
Do we have enough fuel?

00:13:24.513 --> 00:13:26.974
No. We'll have to refuel somewhere.

00:13:27.224 --> 00:13:29.810
Okay. Let's visit some nearby Sky Pirates.

00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:31.979
Okay, Millia?

00:13:32.229 --> 00:13:33.730
Yes.

00:13:47.869 --> 00:13:49.496
Mother...

00:13:49.746 --> 00:13:55.210
Please keep our people safe
and preserve our peace...

00:13:55.460 --> 00:13:58.922
<i>ls all this fighting really necessary?</i>

00:13:59.172 --> 00:14:03.927
<i>Have we not already gained
more than enough living space?</i>

00:14:04.177 --> 00:14:08.390
<i>If this continues, the Augusta
will be branded a mass murderer!</i>

00:14:12.936 --> 00:14:15.897
The invasion operation is progressing smoothly.

00:14:16.148 --> 00:14:18.984
Casualties on our side
are within expected limits.

00:14:19.234 --> 00:14:20.902
What of the vanguard fleet?

00:14:22.946 --> 00:14:25.949
Glacies' air defenses proved
to be too devastating.

00:14:26.199 --> 00:14:29.327
<i>Bates, Rhaetus, Ta OpKsthen,</i>

00:14:29.578 --> 00:14:31.872
and the Chaos provincial
squadrons were all wiped out.

00:14:32.122 --> 00:14:33.999
No ships survived.

00:14:35.751 --> 00:14:37.002
Milady!

00:14:37.252 --> 00:14:39.046
Are you doing well?

00:14:39.296 --> 00:14:40.380
Of course.

00:14:40.630 --> 00:14:43.675
We Survivors of Chaos have
always been strong in that regard.

00:14:45.093 --> 00:14:46.803
Vimal... Dinesh...

00:14:47.054 --> 00:14:49.306
Anand... Shiva...

00:14:54.394 --> 00:14:56.021
Vasant...

00:15:00.358 --> 00:15:03.153
The Federation fleets have penetrated
the second line of air defense.

00:15:03.403 --> 00:15:08.075
How dare they tread upon
the Goddess' territory?!

00:15:08.325 --> 00:15:10.952
Accursed Federation...!

00:15:14.456 --> 00:15:17.667
O Exile, please defend us!

00:15:17.918 --> 00:15:21.546
Grant us the divine protection of the Goddess!

00:15:23.465 --> 00:15:27.677
That which seals the land for eternity...

00:15:35.560 --> 00:15:38.730
Nothing is moving for three miles!

00:15:38.814 --> 00:15:43.944
A snow-white crystal that covers all.

00:15:44.027 --> 00:15:46.446
Good, we've mopped them all up.

00:15:46.696 --> 00:15:50.700
Inform the main fleets that we're
now heading for Glacies' inner--

00:16:11.471 --> 00:16:13.140
Wh-What is that?!

00:16:13.390 --> 00:16:14.891
Estimated altitude, 50!

00:16:15.142 --> 00:16:17.686
They're beyond our battleships' service ceilings!

00:16:21.106 --> 00:16:22.732
No one ever mentioned this!

00:16:25.193 --> 00:16:28.113
A White Legacy...

00:16:29.573 --> 00:16:33.618
All ships, armor-piercing shells!
Prepare for armada-wide salvo!

00:16:33.869 --> 00:16:37.122
Armor-piercing shells!
Prepare for fleet-wide salvo!

00:16:37.372 --> 00:16:40.208
Target the Wall's central eye!

00:16:40.458 --> 00:16:44.254
--Commence fire!
--Commence fire!

00:16:52.012 --> 00:16:53.513
Did we get it?!

00:17:07.944 --> 00:17:09.529
All ships, take evasive action!

00:17:09.779 --> 00:17:11.698
All ships, full astern!

00:17:11.948 --> 00:17:14.701
The 2nd Fleet's Kumbha and
Nikumbha have been obliterated,

00:17:14.951 --> 00:17:17.245
as have the 4th Fleet's Subhadra and Sinhika!

00:17:17.495 --> 00:17:21.249
Six 2nd Fleet ships sunk!
Severe damage to four others!

00:17:21.499 --> 00:17:25.212
Eight 4th Fleet ships sunk!
Severe damage to two others!

00:17:25.462 --> 00:17:27.422
3rd Fleet returning to battle lines!

00:17:27.672 --> 00:17:30.467
Have all ships temporarily
withdraw to the border.

00:17:30.717 --> 00:17:32.177
R°gefl

00:17:37.265 --> 00:17:38.808
Lady Liliana.

00:17:42.562 --> 00:17:44.689
Premier Luscinia has called for you.

00:17:52.739 --> 00:17:55.659
Checking wind speed,
wind direction, and our position...

00:17:55.909 --> 00:17:59.162
Ease up just a little. We're running on fumes.

00:17:59.412 --> 00:18:00.872
<i>Okay -</i>

00:18:02.123 --> 00:18:03.541
Is that good?

00:18:03.792 --> 00:18:06.086
A little more. As slow as possible.

00:18:06.336 --> 00:18:09.089
How long until we reach these
"Spar"-whatever Sky Pirates?

00:18:09.339 --> 00:18:11.508
Spargel. We're almost there.

00:18:11.758 --> 00:18:14.469
Will they really help us just like that?

00:18:14.719 --> 00:18:17.472
It's, you know, "May the wind
carry wings that are lost."

00:18:17.722 --> 00:18:19.724
They'll at least refuel us.

00:18:19.975 --> 00:18:22.060
Sky dwellers look out for each other!

00:18:24.104 --> 00:18:25.981
Look, there it is!

00:18:33.571 --> 00:18:36.574
--Change speed to 130 knots.
--Roger.

00:18:36.825 --> 00:18:38.702
Approach course, three degrees port.

00:18:38.952 --> 00:18:40.662
Three degrees port.

00:18:41.997 --> 00:18:43.456
Lookout spotted.

00:18:43.707 --> 00:18:45.583
Request permission to land, Gisey.

00:18:45.834 --> 00:18:47.294
Rogen

00:18:51.881 --> 00:18:54.009
--Huh?
--What's wrong?

00:18:54.259 --> 00:18:55.552
There's no response...

00:18:55.802 --> 00:18:58.013
We're about to pass the lookout!

00:19:03.852 --> 00:19:05.312
I think something might've happened!

00:19:05.562 --> 00:19:07.147
Fam! Pitch five degrees up!

00:19:07.397 --> 00:19:09.107
Five degrees up!

00:19:22.704 --> 00:19:24.289
Ready for approach.

00:19:32.922 --> 00:19:35.508
They were bombed...?

00:19:35.759 --> 00:19:37.635
But by who?

00:19:37.886 --> 00:19:41.056
These marks were left by the main
guns of battleship-class vessels...

00:19:41.306 --> 00:19:45.268
That's not possible! They can't climb this high!

00:19:45.518 --> 00:19:48.521
Could it be a new Federation weapon...?

00:19:51.107 --> 00:19:52.942
KartoffePs in danger!

00:19:58.490 --> 00:20:01.326
Fleet losses now surpassing 10%!

00:20:10.418 --> 00:20:12.420
You've no qualms?

00:20:12.670 --> 00:20:16.466
My hands have already been stained.

00:20:17.675 --> 00:20:21.054
Great is the power of the Exile.

00:20:21.304 --> 00:20:24.557
Our Winged Goddess is invincible.

00:20:24.808 --> 00:20:29.771
Her sacred power shall
annihilate the Federation.

00:20:30.021 --> 00:20:35.860
The dreadful skies covered in a blue rust...

00:20:37.278 --> 00:20:40.156
Hexad of stars, shining in the heavens...

00:20:43.076 --> 00:20:48.957
May they open only for our brethren.

00:20:50.250 --> 00:20:56.256
Guide us to a place of new birth,
a sacred surface of water...

00:21:03.346 --> 00:21:04.514
Stay calm, Fam!

00:21:04.764 --> 00:21:06.307
S-Sorry!

00:21:07.642 --> 00:21:08.601
Take it easy, Gisey!

00:21:08.852 --> 00:21:10.728
Y-Yeah...

00:21:12.522 --> 00:21:13.606
Sister!

00:21:13.857 --> 00:21:16.901
Have you forgotten what
the Federation did to Turan?!

00:21:17.152 --> 00:21:19.696
This is for the sake of the world.

00:21:19.946 --> 00:21:24.242
If you will not obey me, then I strip you
of your status as a royal princess.

00:21:24.492 --> 00:21:27.579
As of today, we are no longer
sisters or anything else.

00:21:27.829 --> 00:21:29.998
Sister!

00:21:30.248 --> 00:21:33.001
Our next meeting will be on the battlefield.

00:21:34.419 --> 00:21:38.423
<i>If the Federation was behind this attack,</i>

00:21:38.673 --> 00:21:41.593
<i>does that mean Luscinia really
intends to destroy everything?</i>

00:21:41.843 --> 00:21:43.136
<i>And my sister</i> is...

00:21:43.386 --> 00:21:45.972
Let's go, Millia!

00:21:46.222 --> 00:21:48.766
We're all set!

00:21:49.017 --> 00:21:51.144
East-southeast winds, wind force 3.

00:21:51.394 --> 00:21:54.147
Heading: 165. Altitude: 3,000.

00:21:54.397 --> 00:21:56.483
--Increase to cruising speed.
--Roger!

00:21:56.733 --> 00:21:58.902
Now let's hurry to Kartoffel!

00:22:00.487 --> 00:22:02.864
Hey, what's that sound?

00:22:08.244 --> 00:22:10.205
What is that?!

00:22:16.711 --> 00:22:18.963
Don't tell me it's headed for Glacies?!

00:22:21.007 --> 00:22:22.509
Sister...

00:22:23.843 --> 00:22:25.094
Sister!

00:22:25.345 --> 00:22:29.307
Stop!

00:22:31.059 --> 00:22:36.481
<i>How high are the skies,</i>

00:22:36.731 --> 00:22:42.529
<i>how strong are the winds,</i>

00:22:42.779 --> 00:22:48.368
<i>how clear are the waters</i>

00:22:48.618 --> 00:22:55.667
<i>you hold in your heart?</i>

00:22:56.876 --> 00:23:08.346
<i>One day I want to be the palm
of your hand and catch your tears</i>

00:23:08.596 --> 00:23:20.441
<i>I want us to share the
same sorrows, the same air</i>

00:23:20.692 --> 00:23:26.281
<i>I'll point the prow of this departing ship</i>

00:23:26.531 --> 00:23:35.081
<i>Right your way with no hesitation</i>

00:23:35.331 --> 00:23:41.045
<i>Let's raise the mast in this sea of wind</i>

00:23:41.296 --> 00:23:46.843
<i>And set sail on these waves of clouds</i>

00:23:47.093 --> 00:23:52.599
<i>With the faraway stars for a compass</i>

00:23:52.849 --> 00:24:00.523
<i>I'll head beyond the horizon with you</i>

00:24:03.526 --> 00:24:04.569
<i>Wow, how pretty!</i>

00:24:04.819 --> 00:24:08.072
<i>These are pressings of celebratory
flowers scattered throughout the capital</i>

00:24:08.323 --> 00:24:11.326
<i>on the day Augusta Farahniz
held a peace conference.</i>

00:24:11.576 --> 00:24:13.411
<i>You treasure them, I see!</i>

00:24:13.661 --> 00:24:17.332
<i>Yes! And here's a handkerchief
she used at a dinner party,</i>

00:24:17.582 --> 00:24:21.794
<i>and here's some soil she stood
on when she declared peace!</i>

00:24:22.045 --> 00:24:23.504
<i>You actually saved the soil?</i>

00:24:23.755 --> 00:24:27.842
<i>Yes! Augusta Farahnéz
means everything to me!</i>
